                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">For a very long time I've wanted a better way to version control grasshopper files, and to document them, and to share them. Might as well kill three birds with one stone! I first started thinking about this [13 years ago](https://www.grasshopper3d.com/forum/topics/version-control?id=2985220%3ATopic%3A831264) and now</item>
